  "description": "Capture joyful celebration, commercial charm, and modern boutique romance with Black Friday, a sweet modern script font! Designed with plump brush strokes, smooth cursive connections, bouncing baseline movement, and stylish swooping underline swashes, Black Friday transforms promotional words into eye-catching visual treats. A standout choice for seasonal retail sale banners, festive shopping campaigns, cute product packaging, greeting cards, romantic event stationery, and trendy lifestyle branding.",
